@startuml state-trade-lifecycle
title Trade lifecycle

[*] --> Rejected : maturity_date < today (R3)\nor version < stored max (R1)
[*] --> Active : valid trade accepted\n(new trade or higher version)

Active --> Active : same version received (R2)\nrecord replaced
Active --> Expired : maturity_date < today (R4)\nmarked by scheduled job,\nand derived at read time (A6)

Rejected --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

note right of Active
  Maturing today is still Active (A4, A5).
  It becomes Expired the following day.
end note
@enduml